NAME
       eglinfo - report EGL information for the available platforms

SYNOPSIS
       eglinfo [-B] [-p platform]

DESCRIPTION
       eglinfo lists, per EGL platform, the vendor, version, client APIs and
       extension strings, and the supported configurations.  On LikeOS the
       X11 platform is served by Mesa over the software winsys; the client
       APIs are OpenGL and OpenGL ES 2.

OPTIONS
       -B     Brief output: omit the configuration tables.

       -p platform
              Query only the named platform (x11).

SEE ALSO
       glxinfo(1), glxgears(1)

